## 二、枪械切换系统

### 2.1 蓝图实现（WeaponSwitcher蓝图）
```cpp
// 蓝图节点说明（关键节点）
[变量]
- CurrentWeapon (Object Reference)
- WeaponArray (Object Array)

[事件图表]
OnBeginPlay:
  Set CurrentWeapon to WeaponArray[0]

OnKeyPressed (E):
  If CurrentWeapon is not null:
    Set CurrentWeapon to WeaponArray[NextIndex]
    Call SetCurrentWeapon on Character

OnKeyPressed (1/2/3):
  Set CurrentWeapon to WeaponArray[Index]
  Call SetCurrentWeapon on Character
```

### 2.2 C++实现（WeaponSwitcher.h）
```cpp
#pragma once
#include "CoreMinimal.h"
#include "GameFramework/Actor.h"
#include "WeaponSwitcher.generated.h"

UCLASS()
class TPSGAME_API AWeaponSwitcher : public AActor
{
    GENERATED_BODY()
    
public:
    UPROPERTY(EditAnywhere, Category = "Weapons")
    TArray<TSubclassOf<AWeaponBase>> WeaponClasses;

    UPROPERTY(VisibleAnywhere, Category = "Weapons")
    AWeaponBase* CurrentWeapon;

    UFUNCTION(BlueprintCallable, Category = "Weapons")
    void SwitchToWeapon(int32 Index);

    UFUNCTION(BlueprintCallable, Category = "Weapons")
    void NextWeapon();

    void BeginPlay() override;
};
```

### 2.3 C++实现（WeaponSwitcher.cpp）
```cpp
#include "WeaponSwitcher.h"
#include "WeaponBase.h"

void AWeaponSwitcher::BeginPlay()
{
    if (WeaponClasses.Num() > 0)
    {
        CurrentWeapon = GetWorld()->SpawnActor<AWeaponBase>(WeaponClasses[0]);
        CurrentWeapon->AttachToComponent(GetRootComponent(), FAttachmentTransformRules::SnapToTarget);
    }
}

void AWeaponSwitcher::SwitchToWeapon(int32 Index)
{
    if (Index >= 0 && Index < WeaponClasses.Num())
    {
        if (CurrentWeapon) CurrentWeapon->Destroy();
        CurrentWeapon = GetWorld()->SpawnActor<AWeaponBase>(WeaponClasses[Index]);
        CurrentWeapon->AttachToComponent(GetRootComponent(), FAttachmentTransformRules::SnapToTarget);
    }
}

void AWeaponSwitcher::NextWeapon()
{
    static int32 CurrentIndex = 0;
    CurrentIndex = (CurrentIndex + 1) % WeaponClasses.Num();
    SwitchToWeapon(CurrentIndex);
}
```

**性能优化建议**：
- 使用对象池管理武器实例
- 限制武器切换频率（添加冷却时间）
- 使用TArray< TWeakObjectPtr<AWeaponBase> >代替TArray< AWeaponBase* >

