## 三、后坐力系统

### 3.1 蓝图实现（WeaponBase蓝图）
```cpp
// 蓝图节点说明
[变量]
- RecoilStrength (Float)
- RecoilDuration (Float)
- CurrentRecoil (Vector)

[事件图表]
OnFire:
  Set CurrentRecoil to (0, 0, -RecoilStrength)
  Call AddLocalImpulse on Mesh
  Call PlayTimeline (RecoilTimeline)
  
RecoilTimeline:
  0.0s: (0,0,0)
  0.2s: (0,0,-RecoilStrength)
  0.5s: (0,0,0)
```

### 3.2 C++实现（WeaponBase.h）
```cpp
UCLASS()
class TPSGAME_API AWeaponBase : public AActor
{
    GENERATED_BODY()
    
public:
    UPROPERTY(EditAnywhere, Category = "Recoil")
    float RecoilStrength = 1000.0f;

    UPROPERTY(EditAnywhere, Category = "Recoil")
    float RecoilDuration = 0.5f;

    UPROPERTY(VisibleAnywhere, Category = "Recoil")
    FVector CurrentRecoil;

    UFUNCTION(BlueprintCallable, Category = "Weapon")
    void ApplyRecoil();

    void BeginPlay() override;
};
```

### 3.3 C++实现（WeaponBase.cpp）
```cpp
#include "WeaponBase.h"
#include "Components/SceneComponent.h"
#include "Kismet/GameplayStatics.h"

void AWeaponBase::BeginPlay()
{
    Super::BeginPlay();
    // 初始化后坐力组件
    RecoilComponent = CreateDefaultSubobject<USceneComponent>("RecoilComponent");
    RecoilComponent->SetupAttachment(RootComponent);
}

void AWeaponBase::ApplyRecoil()
{
    // 应用后坐力
    FVector Impulse = FVector(0, 0, -RecoilStrength);
    GetRootComponent()->AddLocalImpulse(Impulse);
    
    // 使用定时器恢复
    GetWorld()->GetTimerManager().SetTimer(RecoilTimer, this, &AWeaponBase::ResetRecoil, RecoilDuration, false);
}

void AWeaponBase::ResetRecoil()
{
    GetRootComponent()->SetRelativeRotation(FRotator::ZeroRotator);
}
```

**常见坑点**：
- 避免直接修改Actor旋转导致的坐标系混乱
- 使用FMath::FInterpTo实现平滑恢复
- 注意物理模拟与后坐力的冲突

