## 四、弹道模拟系统

### 4.1 蓝图实现（WeaponBase蓝图）
```cpp
// 关键节点
[事件]
- OnFire (触发射线检测)

[函数]
- FireProjectile:
  - Get Actor Location
  - Get Actor Forward Vector
  - Spawn Projectile at Location
  - Set Projectile Velocity
```

### 4.2 C++实现（WeaponBase.h）
```cpp
UCLASS()
class TPSGAME_API AWeaponBase : public AActor
{
    GENERATED_BODY()
    
public:
    UPROPERTY(EditDefaultsOnly, Category = "Projectile")
    TSubclassOf<AProjectileBase> ProjectileClass;

    UFUNCTION(BlueprintCallable, Category = "Weapon")
    void FireProjectile();
};
```

### 4.3 C++实现（WeaponBase.cpp）
```cpp
void AWeaponBase::FireProjectile()
{
    if (!ProjectileClass) return;
    
    FVector SpawnLocation = GetActorLocation() + GetActorForwardVector() * 100.0f;
    FRotator SpawnRotation = GetActorRotation();
    
    AProjectileBase* Projectile = GetWorld()->SpawnActor<AProjectileBase>(ProjectileClass, SpawnLocation, SpawnRotation);
    if (Projectile)
    {
        FVector Direction = GetActorForwardVector();
        Projectile->SetVelocity(Direction * 5000.0f);
        
        // 添加粒子效果
        UParticleSystemComponent* ParticleComp = UGameplayStatics::SpawnEmitterAtLocation(
            GetWorld(), 
            Projectile->GetParticleTemplate(), 
            SpawnLocation, 
            SpawnRotation
        );
    }
}
```

**性能优化**：
- 使用对象池管理子弹
- 限制射速（使用冷却时间）
- 使用线程安全的碰撞检测

